<pdd-reason>Any local AI harness needs the same authenticated OBS control surface while OBS retains its Twitch authorization and Mixxx retains beat-critical execution.</pdd-reason>
<pdd-interface>
{"type":"module","module":{"functions":[
 {"name":"validate_action","signature":"validate_action(action: str, data: dict | None = None, *, allow_write: bool = False, allow_output: bool = False) -> dict"}
],"classes":[{"name":"OBSControl","methods":[
 "__init__(host='127.0.0.1', port=4455, password=None, timeout_s=5.0)",
